        <mxCell id="legenda" value="&lt;b&gt;Vista de acoplamento — nomes canônicos&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:left;font-size:10px;&#39;&gt;Derivou o estilo (1 quantum). &lt;font color=&#39;#00838F&#39;&gt;╌ reusa o motor&lt;/font&gt; · &lt;font color=&#39;#2E7D46&#39;&gt;━ anexa (Journey)&lt;/font&gt; · &lt;font color=&#39;#E65100&#39;&gt;━ gatilho de mensagem&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#39;#6A1B9A&#39;&gt;━ concede/gera&lt;/font&gt; · &lt;font color=&#39;#3949AB&#39;&gt;━ agenda&lt;/font&gt; · &lt;font color=&#39;#8B5E3C&#39;&gt;━ plano→tarefas&lt;/font&gt; · &lt;font color=&#39;#9E9E9E&#39;&gt;╌ dep./infra&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Form&lt;/b&gt; = só afferent (núcleo reusado). &lt;b&gt;Journey&lt;/b&gt; = só efferent (orquestrador).&lt;br&gt;Base multi-tenant (Auth · Account · Scope) atravessa todos — não desenhada.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
